    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days in Palis is an immersive visual novel set in the fictional super metropolis &quot;Palis.&quot; You are a recently graduated, down-and-out college student facing many life pressures, but the three women who appear in your life completely change the course of your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.poster.avif?t=1754452486\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.webm?t=1754452486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.mp4?t=1754452486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes:  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 static images in 2K resolution   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60 sex animations with sound effects in 2K resolution, expected to update to over 50 in the future </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deeply refined text and storyline, avoiding clich\u00e9s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6  stylistically distinct female characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Files of Days in Palis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isabella, your boss, a mature and caring woman<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/75235949d3ba6727f672a3085503cb59.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Niki, your good friend you met at a bar, a lively and cute college girl<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/f743dffda47481bb49d545f5a28376e5.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille, your landlord, a strong and materialistic business executive<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/fe25a2fe66ab6bf03c9b62201f10b422.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lydia, your new neighbor and Isabella's best friend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/6ba8598c9c7c7a52dc21a621bb142c1a.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jessika, a street girl with a dark past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/71dae9b1719d7c34ca1b2c3cab9456b7.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aven, the private bodyguard leader of the wealthiest family in Palis city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/78620ceeadc89a82aa80ec5adbc7a44a.avif?t=1754452486\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will experience a love story filled with passion, complex relationships, and emotional struggles centered around 5 unique female protagonists, each with a rich background and personality. By gradually unlocking the plot, you will gain a deeper understanding of their inner worlds.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days in Palis is an immersive visual novel set in the fictional super metropolis &quot;Palis.&quot; You are a recently graduated, down-and-out college student facing many life pressures, but the three women who appear in your life completely change the course of your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.poster.avif?t=1754452486\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.webm?t=1754452486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/7c36709e8281a8f85a3e86e20df8c63f.mp4?t=1754452486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes:  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 static images in 2K resolution   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60 sex animations with sound effects in 2K resolution, expected to update to over 50 in the future </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deeply refined text and storyline, avoiding clich\u00e9s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6  stylistically distinct female characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Files of Days in Palis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isabella, your boss, a mature and caring woman<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/75235949d3ba6727f672a3085503cb59.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Niki, your good friend you met at a bar, a lively and cute college girl<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/f743dffda47481bb49d545f5a28376e5.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camille, your landlord, a strong and materialistic business executive<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/fe25a2fe66ab6bf03c9b62201f10b422.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lydia, your new neighbor and Isabella's best friend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/6ba8598c9c7c7a52dc21a621bb142c1a.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jessika, a street girl with a dark past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/71dae9b1719d7c34ca1b2c3cab9456b7.avif?t=1754452486\" width=614 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aven, the private bodyguard leader of the wealthiest family in Palis city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164640/extras/78620ceeadc89a82aa80ec5adbc7a44a.avif?t=1754452486\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will experience a love story filled with passion, complex relationships, and emotional struggles centered around 5 unique female protagonists, each with a rich background and personality. By gradually unlocking the plot, you will gain a deeper understanding of their inner worlds.  </p>",
